{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36778","headline":"感别元帅尚父 · 罗隐","name":"感别元帅尚父","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉函瑶检下台司，记得当时捧领时。\n半壁龙虵蟠造化，满筐山岳动神只。\n疲牛舐犊心犹切，阴鹤鸣雏力已衰。\n稚子不才身抱疾，日窥贞迹泪双垂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36778.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36778","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}